  CustomStringTableItem "{6B3D00000000010A}" {
   Id "OVT-Difficulty_Easy_Desc"
   Target_en_us "Recommended for solo players. Occupying garrisons and patrols are at their smallest."
   Target_de_de "Für Einzelspieler empfohlen. Die Besatzungen und Patrouillen sind auf ein Minimum reduziert."
   Target_ru_ru "Рекомендуется для одиночной игры. Гарнизоны и патрули минимальны."
   Target_uk_ua "Рекомендовано для поодиноких гравців. Гарнізони оккупантів та патрулі мінімальні."
   Comment "Campaign-setup screen (UI/Layouts/Menu/StartGameMenu.layout, the DifficultyDescription widget), shown under the Difficulty spinner when Easy is selected. Held in the 'description' field of Configs/Difficulty/Difficulty_Easy.conf as a stringtable key: TextWidget.SetText translates #-prefixed keys, so the config carries the key and the read site in OVT_StartGameContext needs no change. LENGTH BUDGET: ONE line, about 105 characters. All five difficulty descriptions are held to one line on purpose - the block above the Start button has roughly 180 units of vertical room for four description widgets, and the two faction descriptions already take two lines each. TONE: informs, never instructs. FACT-CHECKED 2026-08-09. The recommendation is the shipped authored text of Difficulty_Easy.conf:3 and carries itself. Smallest garrisons and patrols: Difficulty_Easy.conf:9-11 (patrolGroupsMin 1, patrolGroupsMax 2, defenseGroupsBaseMax 2 - the lowest of the five presets), halved at OVT_InfantrySpawningDeploymentModule.c:486. RE-CITED 2026-08-17 by virtualization/integration Phase 8: the old OVT_OccupyingFactionManager.c:508 read site went with the deleted legacy tower-garrison spawn block, and the halved roll at :416 now sizes town patrols AND tower garrisons alike; the claim itself is unchanged and still true. The claim is deliberately RELATIVE ('smallest') and names no location: the patrol and defence read sites use different arithmetic, so any single quoted number would be false at one of them, but both scale monotonically with the same fields so the ordering is true at both. FORBIDDEN in every difficulty description: real-estate prices scaling with difficulty (realEstateCostMultiplier is declared and replicated but read by nobody - GetBuyPrice and GetRentPrice at OVT_RealEstateManagerComponent.c:712,730 ignore it) and a flat respawn cost (ChargeRespawn only charges above a hardcoded money > 500 gate, OVT_EconomyManagerComponent.c:1874). CORRECTED 2026-08-18 by virtualization/base-defense-migration Phase 8: OVT_BaseUpgradeDefensePosition is DELETED and defenseGroupsBaseMax now has ZERO readers tree-wide (still authored in every Configs/Difficulty/Difficulty_*.conf and still declared at OVT_DifficultySettings.c:45, but read by nothing). The player-facing claim survives on patrolGroupsMin/Max alone, which still scales monotonically across the five presets; base-defence group sizes are now set per deployment module and the amount of defence a faction can afford scales through baseResourcesPerTick/resourcesPerTick into the deployment pool. The old :416 read site is now OVT_InfantrySpawningDeploymentModule.c:486."
   DevNote ""
   Repro ""
   ActorGender NONE
   Terminology NONE
   Status DEVELOPMENT_PENDING
   NonTranslatable 0
   MaxLength 0
   Modified 1780506176
   Author "Claude"
   LastChanged "lemmi"
   ImageLink ""
   Hidden 0
  }
  CustomStringTableItem "{6B3D00000000010D}" {
   Id "OVT-Difficulty_Extreme_Desc"
   Target_en_us "Recommended for very busy servers. A radio is the only equipment you start with."
   Target_de_de "Empfohlen für sehr stark frequentierte Server. Ein Funkgerät ist die einzige Ausrüstung, mit der man startet."
   Target_ru_ru "Рекомендуется для очень загруженных серверов. Из снаряжения у вас только радиостанция."
   Target_uk_ua "Рекомендовано для серверів із високим онлайном. Із початкового спорядження у вас буде лише рація."
   Comment "Campaign-setup screen (UI/Layouts/Menu/StartGameMenu.layout, the DifficultyDescription widget), shown under the Difficulty spinner when Extreme is selected. Held in the 'description' field of Configs/Difficulty/Difficulty_Extreme.conf as a stringtable key. LENGTH BUDGET: ONE line, about 105 characters. TONE: informs, never instructs. FACT-CHECKED 2026-08-09. Recommendation: the shipped authored text of Difficulty_Extreme.conf:3. The radio clause: Difficulty_Extreme.conf's startingItems array holds exactly one entry, Prefabs/Items/Equipment/Radios/Radio_R148.et, where Easy, Normal and Hard each hold an M9 handgun, a 9x19 magazine and the radio; read at OVT_SpawnLogic.c:1177. This is the single most surprising difference between the presets and is why it earned the one clause this line has room for. It is stated as EQUIPMENT ('the only equipment you start with'), not as a total inventory, because clothing comes from the character prefab rather than from startingItems. Starting cash is not mentioned here because the numbers line directly underneath states it. Also true of Extreme but cut for length: fast travel is refused entirely while a QRF is active (QRFFastTravelMode DISABLED, read at OVT_MapContext.c:78-84), which Insane shares."
   DevNote ""
   Repro ""
   ActorGender NONE
   Terminology NONE
   Status DEVELOPMENT_PENDING
   NonTranslatable 0
   MaxLength 0
   Modified 1780506183
   Author "Claude"
