   Comment "Campaign-setup screen (UI/Layouts/Menu/StartGameMenu.layout, the DifficultyDescription widget), shown under the Difficulty spinner when Hard is selected. Held in the 'description' field of Configs/Difficulty/Difficulty_Hard.conf as a stringtable key. LENGTH BUDGET: ONE line, about 105 characters. TONE: informs, never instructs. FACT-CHECKED 2026-08-09. Recommendation: the shipped authored text of Difficulty_Hard.conf:3. Larger garrisons and patrols: Difficulty_Hard.conf:12-14 (patrolGroupsMin 4, patrolGroupsMax 6, defenseGroupsBaseMax 10, against Easy's 1/2/2 and Normal's default 2/4/5), read at OVT_InfantrySpawningDeploymentModule.c:486 (RE-CITED 2026-08-17, Phase 8 of virtualization/integration: the OVT_OccupyingFactionManager.c:508 read site went with the deleted legacy tower-garrison spawn block); stated relatively and with no location named, for the reason recorded on OVT-Difficulty_Easy_Desc. Building costs more: Difficulty_Hard.conf placeableCostMultiplier 1.5 and buildableCostMultiplier 1.5 against Easy's 0.8 and Normal's default 1, read at OVT_OverthrowConfigComponent.c:252 and :257. Real-estate prices are NOT mentioned and must not be: realEstateCostMultiplier is a dead field. CORRECTED 2026-08-18 by virtualization/base-defense-migration Phase 8: OVT_BaseUpgradeDefensePosition is DELETED and defenseGroupsBaseMax now has ZERO readers tree-wide (still authored in every Configs/Difficulty/Difficulty_*.conf and still declared at OVT_DifficultySettings.c:45, but read by nothing). The player-facing claim survives on patrolGroupsMin/Max alone, which still scales monotonically across the five presets; base-defence group sizes are now set per deployment module and the amount of defence a faction can afford scales through baseResourcesPerTick/resourcesPerTick into the deployment pool. The old :416 read site is now OVT_InfantrySpawningDeploymentModule.c:486."
